# Scheme Up frontend configuration
# Copy to `.env` and adjust. NEVER commit the real .env file.

# Base URL for API calls. Leave as /api in development — Vite proxies /api to
# the backend (see vite.config.ts, override the proxy target with
# VITE_API_PROXY_URL). Set a full URL (e.g. https://api.example.com/api) when
# the backend is deployed separately.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# Backend target for the dev-server proxy:
# VITE_API_PROXY_URL=http://localhost:8000

# The AI assistant does NOT need any frontend configuration: chat requests go
# through the backend, which holds the AI credentials server-side.
